{"reviews":[{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-0","r":5.0,"t":"Good fitting and very comfortable","x":"Great COMFORTABLE masks!! I have a smaller face and usually have to buy small masks but these fit me comfortably. They also fit my husband fine and he has a normal size face. Very comfy, don\u2019t ride up. I can comfortably work out in it without feeling like I\u2019m not getting enough air.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-1","r":3.0,"t":"Good for a smaller person","x":"I didn\u2019t like that the mask was on the small side - it  fit my very small 15 yr grandchild. I also thought they were too thin but can still be used. If you want a small then mask for a smaller head or face you would like this.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-2","r":5.0,"t":"totally worth it","x":"these passed the lighter test, held water fully, and are super comfy. they ARE the flex fabric that is smooth and is supposed to cool your face and not give you mask acne. i would totally recommend. the one thing is that the edge in the middle is not sewn together but the fabric is burned together. this isn\u2019t bad as it holds. but just a heads up. but yeah these are great. they\u2019re also really breathable","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-3","r":1.0,"t":"Waste of money","x":"These are huge!  They do not stay in place and there is no way for me to wear them and feel like I am protected.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-4","r":5.0,"t":"Love them!","x":"Love them! Super soft and thin! Easy to breathe in!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-5","r":5.0,"t":"Very comfortable","x":"Ordered these before.  They are comfortable & wash up great! Bought more colors & they are really pretty!  Thank you!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-6","r":2.0,"t":"do not buy these!","x":"these masks are super thin. i wouksnt recommend getting them. they dont pass the \u201ccandle\u201d test.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-7","r":1.0,"t":"Junk","x":"Very thin and not worth the money or even less. I returned with no second thoughts.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-8","r":5.0,"t":"Lightweight","x":"Single layer of lightweight, breathable fabric. Colorful and individually packaged.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-9","r":5.0,"t":"Good and lightweight","x":"I like these masks and wish I'd bought them sooner. The only downfall is they have a weird smell at first. I haven't washed them yet so I don't know if it will go away or how they hold up with washing/multiple use.  Edit: No smell after washing.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-10","r":5.0,"t":"Comfortable","x":"These are comfortable and easy to breath in. I work in health care and can wear all day without the mask cutting into my ears and face. They wash and dry perfectly. I will be buying again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-11","r":1.0,"t":"Trash Masks","x":"Masks were pretty but had uneven shape/cutout with itchy, uncomfortable material. I expected cheap and thin but these were useless and ended up in the bin.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-12","r":3.0,"t":"Comfy but eat loops stretch out quick.","x":"These are comfortable and nice and lightweight. However the ears stretch out quickly so they do not stay on your face after repeated use.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-13","r":5.0,"t":"Very comfortable and fit perfectly on me.","x":"This just arrived about 10 minutes ago and I tried them on and put them in the washer. When I tried them on I realized that they were pretty thick  (which is good) at least  thicker than other cloth masks. I really like the colors and how they were packaged and I would definitely buy more of this product!  Overall I really like them!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-14","r":5.0,"t":"over all -- great","x":"Wife loves them. The only thing I had to do for my comfort is to trim down the cheek section under my eyes to keep the cloth from pushing up under my lower eye lid.  I wear glasses, so I have to put the mask way up on my nose under the nose pieces to keep my glasses from fogging (that is the way it is with any mask).","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-15","r":4.0,"t":"Very comfortable, but big and thin","x":"They are very comfortable except that they are very large for an average woman's face. Perfect for my larger husband. If you're actually looking for protection, these are not for you but I don't think they claim to be for anything other than 'fashion'. I would love them to be a bit thicker and smaller.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-16","r":3.0,"t":"Demasiado delgadas","x":"Muy delgadas, si son c\u00f3modas pero demasiado delgadas... a\u00fan leyendo los comentarios me arriesgu\u00e9 a comprar estas mascarillas, pensando que tal vez ser\u00eda distintas... pero obtuve por lo que pague... a\u00fan me sirvaran pero usando otro cubrebocas encima o por debajo de ellas.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-17","r":5.0,"t":"I love these lightweight masks!","x":"I wanted something comfy and light for the warmer months to come. Also, it\u2019s a loose fit - but again, I wanted something that wasn\u2019t tight around my ears or face. So all around it\u2019s great!! Oh and the colors are cute too.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-18","r":3.0,"t":"Cute Won't Stay on Ears","x":"Cute, Using 2 at a time.  Pink over grey is adorable.  Doesn't matter because masks pop off ears often.  Annoying.  I will shop for a behind the head clip on for them.  Note:  Always rinse new close to skin items.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-19","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect","x":"I like that these don\u2019t get wet and warm. Pop them in the washer and they\u2019re dry in a few minutes just sitting out. I feel like I can breathe easily because they don\u2019t get all warm and wet like other ones.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-20","r":5.0,"t":"6 Stars","x":"I love them! They are so nice! Soft, comfortable, and fit great! Perfect size for a full sized adult! I\u2019d definitely order again! Low key thing about getting more! Makes me not dread having to wear masks!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-21","r":5.0,"t":"This is the best one","x":"I have 2 similar face maskes like this but this is the best one. Size is perfect, very soft and most of all, more space under nose/mouth area so doesn't feel like mask stuck to your mouth.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-22","r":1.0,"t":"Bad fit","x":"The fabric is not exactly what I expected, but I can deal with that. The center seam, however,  is really awkward and puckers. They are not uncomfortable to wear, they just look bad.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-23","r":5.0,"t":"Anti-mask","x":"I do not believe in masks, I've been opposed.  That being said, they are mandated everywhere.  These are perfect for people like me.  Lightweight, breathable.  Thank you so much.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B08HPSMC2C-24","r":5.0,"t":"You\u2019ll Barely Know its There!","x":"Very comfortable. This mask doesn\u2019t pull or rub your ears or burn your eyes like some of the disposables. It doesn\u2019t ride up or down or touch your lips! Very nice feel.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the masks comfortable and soft, often noting they are easy to breathe in.","cites":[1,3,5,6,11,13,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers describe the masks as thin or lightweight, with opinions split on whether this is good or a drawback.","cites":[2,5,7,8,9,12]},{"text":"Fit is inconsistent: some say they suit smaller faces well, while others find them too small or, conversely, too huge.","cites":[1,2,4]},{"text":"Some reviewers report the ear loops stretch out quickly and the masks do not stay in place.","cites":[4,13]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention washing well and holding up, though one notes an initial smell that went away after washing.","cites":[6,10,11]}]},"qa":[]}